menu "Mosaico example"
    config MOSAICO_PANEL
        bool "Drive the physical panel, touch, FN and BOOT"
        default n
        help
            CO5300 QSPI panel and CST9220 touch. Detect the board revision
            from eFuse before selecting pins. POWER in the viewer toggles
            the display; the physical ON/OFF switch is not a GPIO input.
endmenu
